  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "644b4a2cccbdb3c4",
      "translationZh": "🧭简要概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e036e9ff07b8caab",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face AI Sheets 是一款全新的开源工具，无需编写代码，即可使用 AI 模型构建、丰富和转换数据集。该工具可以部署在本地或 Hub 上。它支持通过 Inference Providers 使用 Hugging Face Hub 上的数千个开放模型，也支持使用本地模型，其中包括 OpenAI 的 gpt-oss！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "44cf6ffe1e9a7442",
      "translationZh": "实用链接",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30c0096ae808e77c",
      "translationZh": "免费试用该工具（无需安装）：https://huggingface.co/spaces/aisheets/sheets 在本地安装并运行：https://github.com/huggingface/sheets",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3a0a938661550424",
      "translationZh": "什么是 AI Sheets",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d57edfa7ed7f1d8",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 是一款无代码工具，可使用（开放的）AI 模型构建、转换和丰富数据集。它与 Hub 和开源 AI 生态系统紧密集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ec72aa29e0ee83b",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 采用类似电子表格的用户界面，易于上手。该工具围绕快速实验而设计，让你先从小型数据集入手，再运行耗时或成本高昂的数据生成流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efd6e2c316a4ba2f",
      "translationZh": "在 AI Sheets 中，你可以通过编写提示词来创建新列，并根据需要反复迭代，还可以编辑单元格或验证单元格，教会模型理解你的需求。不过，这些内容稍后再详细介绍！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cc0326dddf3bf49d",
      "translationZh": "我可以用它做什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5fd8a25913dfecb",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 AI Sheets 来：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17c16459c72626ec",
      "translationZh": "比较模型，并凭直观感受测试模型。假设你想用自己的数据测试最新的模型。你可以导入一个包含提示词/问题的数据集，然后创建多个列（每个模型对应一列），使用这样的提示词：回答以下问题：{{prompt}}，其中 prompt 是数据集中的一列。你可以手动验证结果，也可以新建一列，使用让大语言模型担任评判的提示词，例如：评估以下问题的回答：{{prompt}}。回答 1：{{model1}}。回答 2：{{model2}}，其中 model1 和 model2 是数据集中包含不同模型回答的列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3c599b2e8daeeee",
      "translationZh": "针对你的数据和特定模型改进提示词。假设你想构建一个应用程序，用于处理客户请求并自动给出回答。你可以加载一个包含客户请求的示例数据集，然后开始尝试并迭代不同的提示词和模型，以生成回答。AI Sheets 有一个很酷的功能：你可以通过编辑或确认单元格内容来提供反馈。这些示例单元格会自动添加到你的提示词中。你可以把它看作一种工具，让你通过实时查看数据，非常高效地微调提示词，并向提示词中添加少样本示例！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5907e20c9d6067e4",
      "translationZh": "转换数据集。假设你想清理数据集中的某一列。你可以添加一个新列，使用这样的提示词：移除以下文本中多余的标点符号：{{text}}，其中 text 是数据集中包含待清理文本的一列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab05858fafffa2d8",
      "translationZh": "对数据集进行分类。假设你想对数据集中的一些内容进行分类。你可以添加一个新列，使用这样的提示词：对以下文本进行分类：{{text}}，其中 text 是数据集中包含待分类文本的一列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e790fa995f44407",
      "translationZh": "分析数据集。假设你想提取数据集中的主要观点。你可以添加一个新列，使用这样的提示词：从以下内容中提取最重要的观点：{{text}}，其中 text 是数据集中包含待分析文本的一列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a04d73b20067e39a",
      "translationZh": "丰富数据集。假设你的数据集中有一些地址缺少邮政编码。你可以添加一个新列，使用这样的提示词：查找以下地址的邮政编码：{{address}}（在这种情况下，你必须启用“Search the web”选项，以确保结果准确）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29522974bc015216",
      "translationZh": "生成合成数据集。假设你需要一个包含逼真电子邮件的数据集，但出于数据隐私原因，无法获取这些数据。你可以使用这样的提示词来创建数据集：为一位制药公司领域的专业人士撰写一段简短介绍，并将该列命名为 person_bio。然后，你可以使用这样的提示词创建另一列：撰写一封逼真的工作邮件，就像是由以下这位人士撰写的一样：{{person_bio}}。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4eaa76cf77d8004",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们深入了解如何使用它！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ffa04c25b1059024",
      "translationZh": "如何使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9a6d067722c1b7a",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 提供了两种入门方式：导入现有数据，或从零开始生成数据集。加载数据后，你可以通过添加列、编辑单元格和重新生成内容来完善数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "831d0f72d242b7d1",
      "translationZh": "开始使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62923b847f864bea",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，你需要用自然语言描述数据集，从零开始创建一个，或者导入现有数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02900b5b26fc6357",
      "translationZh": "从零开始生成数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f813cee8ba2f7204",
      "translationZh": "最适合：熟悉 AI Sheets、头脑风暴、快速实验以及创建测试数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f12673172e65b632",
      "translationZh": "可以把它看作一种自动生成数据集或通过提示词生成数据集的功能——你只需描述自己的需求，AI Sheets 就会为你创建完整的数据集结构和内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ed0f6f67a738b56",
      "translationZh": "适用场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00763ddf6fc88372",
      "translationZh": "你是第一次探索 AI Sheets",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14a33c49b5679a70",
      "translationZh": "你需要用于测试或原型开发的合成数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5ba8b6ea9986a5b",
      "translationZh": "数据准确性和多样性并非关键要求（例如，针对用例开展头脑风暴、快速研究、生成测试数据集）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb314626b88c203c",
      "translationZh": "你想快速尝试各种想法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ddbc7b3c4ec8cf8",
      "translationZh": "操作方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0aa3093390d7fdcb",
      "translationZh": "在提示词输入区域描述你想要的数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56e2abd6e966f511",
      "translationZh": "示例：“一份虚构初创公司列表，包含名称、行业和口号”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f073412731faa7f",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 会生成数据结构，并创建 5 行示例数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f74377276e9cde8",
      "translationZh": "可扩展至最多 1,000 行，或修改提示词以更改结构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d029f87e3d80f8fd",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faae5567009addd0",
      "translationZh": "如果你输入以下提示词：世界各地的城市，以及它们所属的国家，并为每座城市生成一张吉卜力风格的地标图片：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a972cb390854ed3",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 会自动生成一个包含三列的数据集，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef0d658a872b47f9",
      "translationZh": "这个数据集只有五行，但你可以在每一列向下拖动来添加更多单元格，图片列也不例外！你还可以在任意单元格中填写内容，然后通过拖动补全其他单元格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "205fe076bbd00f50",
      "translationZh": "接下来的章节将向你展示如何迭代和扩展数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b2065663033e094",
      "translationZh": "导入你的数据集（推荐）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07cb7fa33aa9b291",
      "translationZh": "最适合：需要对真实世界的数据进行转换、分类、丰富和分析的大多数用例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f132693254a38f1",
      "translationZh": "大多数用例都推荐采用这种方式，因为与从零开始相比，导入真实数据能让你拥有更多控制权和灵活性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ed0f6f67a738b56",
      "translationZh": "适用情形：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd1863a23bbbac22",
      "translationZh": "你已有数据，需要使用 AI 模型进行转换或丰富",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb9352cccb09314a",
      "translationZh": "你想生成合成数据，并且重视准确性和多样性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ddbc7b3c4ec8cf8",
      "translationZh": "操作方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "358f1ba2cc16c637",
      "translationZh": "上传 XLS、TSV、CSV 或 Parquet 格式的数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9af7ba42910ad90c",
      "translationZh": "确保你的文件至少包含一个列名和一行数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8af1804da4522720",
      "translationZh": "最多可上传 1,000 行（列数不限）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7da9d91c6cc2f823",
      "translationZh": "你的数据会以熟悉的电子表格格式呈现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15b022f84c1cba92",
      "translationZh": "实用技巧：如果你的文件中数据很少，可以直接在电子表格中输入，手动添加更多条目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2059c8fffb7e721c",
      "translationZh": "使用你的数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a98aff42f1245e89",
      "translationZh": "数据加载完成后（无论你以何种方式开始），你都会在一个可编辑的电子表格界面中看到它。以下是你需要了解的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8be58a96db00bb0",
      "translationZh": "了解 AI Sheets",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c091064df75c40d4",
      "translationZh": "导入的单元格：可手动编辑，但无法通过 AI 提示词修改",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "808f3af9b05e091d",
      "translationZh": "AI 生成的单元格：可以使用提示词和你的反馈（编辑 + 点赞）重新生成并改进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f52c3b623bc36bb7",
      "translationZh": "新列：始终由 AI 驱动，并且可完全自定义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6114bd75182a9ab9",
      "translationZh": "AI 列入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "574780b6a2511ea3",
      "translationZh": "点击“+”按钮添加新列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74bc2ed6b5ea3b30",
      "translationZh": "从推荐操作中选择：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2bfa8d15e38728dd",
      "translationZh": "提取特定信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d71374c4697d4bb",
      "translationZh": "总结长文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b437495654095ad7",
      "translationZh": "翻译内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c03e60ab949c2b1f",
      "translationZh": "或者使用“对 {{column}} 执行某项操作”编写自定义提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91c48fc27cfec869",
      "translationZh": "完善并扩充数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51ed7837256f0e4e",
      "translationZh": "现在你已经有了 AI 列，可以改进其结果并扩充数据。你可以通过手动编辑和点赞提供反馈，或调整列配置来改进结果。这两种方式都需要重新生成才能生效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9a560959835f944",
      "translationZh": "1. 如何添加更多单元格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "522e4fc62d9400e2",
      "translationZh": "向下拖动：从某列的最后一个单元格向下拖动，即可立即生成更多行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2ae78866e05f895",
      "translationZh": "无需重新生成——新单元格会即时创建",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7bab2b36db857c7",
      "translationZh": "你也可以用这种方式重新生成出错的单元格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bd4c6ef5f0a6f37",
      "translationZh": "2. 手动编辑与反馈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d29c0db2c5c8b71",
      "translationZh": "编辑单元格：点击任意单元格即可直接编辑内容——这会为模型提供你所偏好的输出示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c5c8ab2a8686331",
      "translationZh": "为结果点赞：使用点赞按钮标记优质输出示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8705155788f97776",
      "translationZh": "重新生成，将反馈应用到该列中的其他单元格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9e247583b39e214",
      "translationZh": "在底层，当你重新生成或在该列中添加更多单元格时，这些经过手动编辑和点赞的单元格将被用作少样本示例，来生成单元格内容！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7beab676c89390",
      "translationZh": "3. 调整列配置 更改提示词、切换模型或提供商，或修改设置，然后重新生成以获得更好的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afaa2886c89672bf",
      "translationZh": "重写提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c659547713cf94b4",
      "translationZh": "每一列都有自己的生成提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e95bacba5eba9ac",
      "translationZh": "随时编辑，以更改或改进输出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f755a3421e0be14",
      "translationZh": "该列会重新生成，显示新的结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cdf25206b5f8d4c",
      "translationZh": "切换模型/提供商",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9eafb5f6b31e1ff4",
      "translationZh": "尝试不同的模型，以获得不同的表现，或对它们进行比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a13883698413d8e4",
      "translationZh": "对于特定任务，有些模型比其他模型更准确、更有创造力，或输出更有条理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e00483cfcffee60",
      "translationZh": "有些提供商的推理速度更快，上下文长度也有所不同；可以为所选模型测试不同的提供商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2af2b18c7225fafc",
      "translationZh": "开启或关闭搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e620e061764afd7d",
      "translationZh": "启用：模型从网络获取最新信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d711243943eef740",
      "translationZh": "禁用：离线，仅依靠模型生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "99575ad0f124398b",
      "translationZh": "将最终数据集导出到 Hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cd39ab3e2a503b1",
      "translationZh": "当你对新数据集感到满意时，就将它导出到 Hub 吧！这样还有一个额外的好处：生成一个可复用的配置文件，用于 (1) 通过此脚本使用 HF jobs 生成更多数据，以及 (2) 在下游应用中复用提示词，包括来自你编辑过并点赞的单元格的少样本示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4abee84cb956e97e",
      "translationZh": "这里有一个使用 AISheets 创建的数据集示例，它会生成这份配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ef91c9c5defd3abc",
      "translationZh": "使用 HF Jobs 运行数据生成脚本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d45deb15ef8df83",
      "translationZh": "如果你想生成更大的数据集，可以使用上文提到的配置和脚本，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e68ee04dff59551b",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38081d867869434e",
      "translationZh": "本节提供了一些可使用 AI Sheets 构建的数据集示例，为你的下一个项目提供灵感。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2cd562bc89133cd1",
      "translationZh": "凭感觉测试并比较模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6edb6a93acae3b0",
      "translationZh": "如果你想用不同的提示词和你关心的数据来测试最新模型，AI Sheets 就是你的理想搭档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0652056e85b4c3a",
      "translationZh": "你只需导入一个数据集（或从零创建一个），然后为想要测试的模型分别添加不同的列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beee9c93c7c8d4ba",
      "translationZh": "接着，你可以手动检查结果，也可以添加一列，使用大语言模型来评判每个模型的质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8d4fe2d6f40708d",
      "translationZh": "下面的示例比较了开放的前沿模型在构建迷你 Web 应用方面的表现。AI Sheets 让你可以查看交互式结果，并试用每个应用。此外，该数据集还包含多个使用大语言模型来评判和比较应用质量的列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8c64513be415321",
      "translationZh": "从我们刚才描述的这类会话中导出的示例数据集：：https://huggingface.co/datasets/dvilasuero/jsvibes-qwen-gpt-oss-judged",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40c52d41047a44d9",
      "translationZh": "配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
