    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0a02829127c4fa68",
      "translationZh": "为 Hub 数据集添加类别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fae4e018c8455af3",
      "translationZh": "AI Sheets 还可以扩充现有数据集，帮助你快速开展涉及文本数据集分析的数据分析和数据科学项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d397eba53b2f7154",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个为现有 Hub 数据集添加类别的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0d904e78900e783",
      "translationZh": "一个很酷的功能是，你可以手动验证或编辑初始分类结果，并重新生成整列以改善结果，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
