      "sourceHash": "40c52d41047a44d9",
      "translationZh": "配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e3a123538b62492",
      "translationZh": "使用 LLMs-as-Judge 评估模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08632f3d4cd5cb4d",
      "translationZh": "另一个用例是采用让 LLM 担任评判者的方法来评估模型输出。这对于比较模型或评估现有数据集的质量很有用，例如，在 Hugging Face Hub 上的现有数据集上微调模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acb5b4608b0f7d4d",
      "translationZh": "在第一个示例中，我们将凭感觉测试与一个由评判 LLM 生成的列结合起来。以下是评判提示词：",
